        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105274?u=173310b843e2751843265438af8cfb79eda02039&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<ul class="contains-task-list">
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> Rewrites the <code class="notranslate">@supports font-format</code> example to fix the mistake.</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> Fixes the color font example URL to link to a font file, not CSS.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>The <code class="notranslate">src</code> is a descriptor exclusive to <code class="notranslate">@font-face</code>, not a property that can be set.</li>
<li>Google Fonts serves CSS files at these URL, not font files.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<p dir="auto">Initially <a href="https://typo.social/@pixelambacht/115441236943309738" rel="nofollow">reported on Mastodon</a> by <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/RoelN/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/RoelN">@RoelN</a></p>]]></content>
